<h1 id="uimockport-title" style="color:#0d47a1;font-size:1.5em;font-weight:700;border-bottom:2px solid #90caf9;padding-bottom:0.25em;margin-top:0"><code>uimockport</code> — UI mock → fixture → production</h1>

Use when the user includes **`uimockport`**. Delivers learner-facing UI through **four gated phases** on **one reference plan** — never split into parallel plan files for the same feature.

**Chain:** This rule **extends** **qimpltdd** (`.cursor/rules/tdd/qimpltdd-quick-implement-refactor-plan.mdc`). Apply **§3 substitution table** from **qimpltdd** at every delegate. **Do not** mix chain 1 (**qimpl** / **aciub** / **implref**) on the same UI strand.

