<h2 id="uimockport-trigger" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">1. Trigger</h2>

| User says | Agent does |
|-----------|------------|
| **`uimockport`** + feature description (no plan) | Step 1 ambiguity → create **one** `REFACTOR_UI_*.md` → run phases **1→4** on that plan via **qimpltdd** discipline. |
| **`uimockport`** + existing **`REFACTOR_UI_*.md`** | Resume first incomplete phase on **that plan only** — refresh plan if drift, then continue. |
| **`uimockport`** + “phase N only” | Execute **only phase N** on the named plan; update plan checkboxes; do **not** start phase N+1 without user ask. |

**Single-plan rule:** One execution = one **`cursor_gen/refactor_plans/new/REFACTOR_UI_<SHORT_TOPIC>.md`**. Move to **`wip/`** / **`completed/`** per **implreftdd** step 3.5 — never fork a second plan for the same screen/feature.

