<h2 id="uimockport-plan" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">2. One reference plan</h2>

**Author with onlyreftdd** shape (MRKD + TDD bar). Required front-matter block (YAML or table after title):

| Field | Content |
|-------|---------|
| **Feature** | Plain name (e.g. “Profile scoreboard v13”) |
| **Canvas path** | `.cursor/projects/<workspace>/canvases/<name>.canvas.tsx` — update when created |
| **Prod components** | Target dir e.g. `apps/web/src/components/<domain>/` |
| **Shared types** | e.g. `utils/ui/<domain>/types.ts` |
| **Fixture JSON** | e.g. `apps/web/src/fixtures/<domain>/<fixture>.json` |
| **Preview surface** | Dev route (default) or Storybook story path |
| **API endpoints** | FastAPI routes to wire in phase 4 |
| **Visual reference** | Link or note: canvas screenshot / `#visual-baseline` in plan |

**Plan MUST contain exactly these numbered phases** (checkboxes `[ ]` / `[X]`):

| Phase | Name | Exit criterion (summary) |
|-------|------|---------------------------|
| **1** | Canvas sketch | User-approved layout; tokens extracted to plan |
| **2** | Prod structure | Components compile; **no** `cursor/canvas` imports in repo |
| **3** | Fixture + visual match | Preview route/story; Vitest + optional screenshot diff vs canvas |
| **4** | Wire real data | API + integration tests; profile/production route works |

**Keep updating this file** after every phase: checkboxes, canvas path, fixture path, Decision log, TDD bar rows.

