<h2 id="uimockport-phases" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">3. Workflow phases</h2>

<h3 id="uimockport-phase1" style="color:#00695c;font-size:1.05em;font-weight:600;margin-top:0.85em">3.1 Phase 1 — Prompt → Canvas sketch</h3>

| Step | Action |
|------|--------|
| 1 | **Ambiguity gate** (qimpl step 1): product/layout decisions only. |
| 2 | Create or edit **`canvases/<feature>-mockup.canvas.tsx`** using **`cursor/canvas`** primitives. |
| 3 | Iterate with user on **layout, columns, copy placeholders, mock rows** — **fake data inline** is OK here. |
| 4 | **Extract to plan** before phase 2: `SCOREBOARD_GRID`-style constants (columns, stack width, font sizes, colors) as a table in the plan. |
| 5 | User sign-off: “canvas looks right” or explicit proceed — **do not port** until phase 1 `[X]`. |

**Canvas = sketchbook only.** After phase 1, **stop editing canvas** for polish; all visual fixes go to prod CSS/components (phase 3).

<h3 id="uimockport-phase2" style="color:#00695c;font-size:1.05em;font-weight:600;margin-top:0.85em">3.2 Phase 2 — Prod component structure (no live API)</h3>

| Step | Action |
|------|--------|
| 1 | Create **`utils/ui/<domain>/layout.ts`** (or extend) — import grid/constants from plan extraction; **single source** for CSS. |
| 2 | Port **structure** into **`apps/web/src/components/<domain>/`** using **MUI + project CSS + i18n** — **zero** `cursor/canvas` imports. |
| 3 | Use **temporary inline props** or minimal placeholder fixture in Vitest — enough to render empty/table shell. |
| 4 | Vitest smoke: components mount, testids present. |
| 5 | **Do not** wire `fetch*` / profile route yet. **Do not** claim visual parity yet. |

<h3 id="uimockport-phase3" style="color:#00695c;font-size:1.05em;font-weight:600;margin-top:0.85em">3.3 Phase 3 — Fixture JSON + visual match</h3>

| Step | Action |
|------|--------|
| 1 | **Fixture JSON** — see [§5](#uimockport-smooth); shape **must** match shared TypeScript types (same as API). |
| 2 | **Preview surface** (default: **dev route** e.g. `apps/web/src/pages/dev/<Feature>PreviewPage.tsx`; optional: Storybook story). |
| 3 | Feed preview **only** from fixture JSON — **no API**, no login. |
| 4 | **Pixel checklist** pass: borders, padding, fonts, legend, pills, grid alignment — diff against canvas screenshot; fix **CSS only** unless structure wrong. |
| 5 | Vitest: fixture-driven tests (untouched segment, friendly labels, grid shell structure). Optional: Playwright screenshot of preview vs baseline PNG. |
| 6 | Phase 3 `[X]` only when user or checklist confirms **visual match ~90%+** on fixture data. |

<h3 id="uimockport-phase4" style="color:#00695c;font-size:1.05em;font-weight:600;margin-top:0.85em">3.4 Phase 4 — Wire real API + backend</h3>

| Step | Action |
|------|--------|
| 1 | Wire production page to **`fetch*`** client; types unchanged from phase 3. |
| 2 | Backend: aggregation, scope normalization, catalog pool — **strict-TDD** pytest for any new contract. |
| 3 | Integration test: real API path returns shape matching fixture types. |
| 4 | Restart API if local (`run_all restart`) when backend changed. |
| 5 | Compare live profile vs fixture preview — document **data-only** diffs in plan Decision log (not CSS regressions). |

