<h2 id="uimockport-gates" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">4. Phase gates</h2>

<table>
<thead>
<tr style="background:#1565c0;color:white"><th>Forbidden skip</th><th>Why</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td style="background:#ffebee">Phase 2 → live profile/API</td><td style="background:#ffebee">Hides backend bugs in UI tuning (scoreboard cardinals)</td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#ffebee">Phase 1 → phase 4 in one prompt</td><td style="background:#ffebee">Structure without fixture → ~50% visual parity</td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#ffebee">Ongoing canvas edits after phase 1</td><td style="background:#ffebee">Double maintenance; prod drifts</td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#ffebee">Second UI kit in prod handoff</td><td style="background:#ffebee">No `cursor/canvas` in `apps/web`</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>

