<h2 id="uimockport-smooth" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">5. Smooth-copy rules</h2>

| Rule | Requirement |
|------|-------------|
| **Same components** | Preview route and production route render **identical** component tree; only `data` prop source differs. |
| **Shared constants** | Grid columns, stack width, tone thresholds in **`utils/ui/<domain>/layout.ts`** → CSS vars or imported class maps. |
| **Fixture JSON sources** | (priority order) ① export rows from canvas mock ② `curl` snapshot of good API response ③ hand-made edge case (e.g. 58 untouched). |
| **Fixture location** | `apps/web/src/fixtures/<domain>/*.json` — committed to git. |
| **Types** | `utils/ui/<domain>/types.ts` — fixture and API both satisfy this interface. |
| **i18n** | All learner-visible strings via **`apps/web/src/i18n/`** — not hardcoded from canvas English. |

