<h2 id="uimockport-qimpl" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">6. qimpltdd per phase</h2>

For **each phase** on the single reference plan:

1. **Update plan** — TDD bar row for this phase (mode, test-first artifact, red case, green gate).
2. **Execute** — **aciubtdd** / **implreftdd** on **that plan path**; complete **only** the current phase’s checkboxes unless user invoked full **`uimockport`** without “phase N only”.
3. **Test order** — **strict-TDD** for contracts (types, API shape, fixture loader, bucket math); **smoke-after-delete** for removing dev-only scaffolding.
4. **Mark `[X]`** on phase heading when green gate passes.
5. **Closing table** — SUPER concise layman HTML table (MRKD 6.1) after each phase **or** after full run — include **Visual %**, **Fixture path**, **Plans path**.

**Delegate map:**

| Need | Rule |
|------|------|
| Full orchestration | **qimpltdd** |
| Plan shape | **onlyreftdd** |
| Implement loop | **aciubtdd** + **implreftdd** |
| Layman tables | **evalay** (if user asks) |

