<h2 id="uimockport-stop" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">7. Stop conditions</h2>

Pause only for:

- User has not approved canvas (phase 1 gate).
- Product/schema choice only user can make.
- Phase 3 visual checklist fails after **two** CSS iteration rounds — report diff list + screenshot paths.
- Backend contract unknown — add pytest red case to plan, stop phase 4 until shape agreed.

**Not** stop conditions: work is multi-phase; tests are verbose; API restart needed.

