<h2 id="uimockport-anti" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">8. Anti-patterns (scoreboard v13)</h2>

<table>
<thead>
<tr style="background:#1565c0;color:white"><th>Mistake</th><th>Fix in this rule</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td style="background:#e3f2fd">Grid per row → columns drift</td><td style="background:#e8f5e9">Phase 2: single shell grid + subgrid; test DOM structure in phase 3</td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#e3f2fd">Canvas fake data hid API bugs</td><td style="background:#e8f5e9">Phase 4 strict-TDD integration; fixture includes edge-case row</td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#e3f2fd">Global CSS broke pills</td><td style="background:#e8f5e9">Phase 3 pixel checklist + scoped classes</td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#e3f2fd">“Port canvas” = done</td><td style="background:#e8f5e9">Phase 2 = structure only; phase 3 = visual done definition</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>

