<h2 id="uimockport-self" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">9. Self-check (agent)</h2>

- [ ] User invoked **`uimockport`**.
- [ ] Exactly **one** `REFACTOR_UI_*.md` for this feature execution.
- [ ] Plan lists canvas path, fixture path, preview surface, API routes.
- [ ] Phases executed in order (or single phase if user scoped).
- [ ] **No** `cursor/canvas` imports under `apps/web/`.
- [ ] Phase 3 preview works **without** API.
- [ ] Phase 4 types match phase 3 fixture interface.
- [ ] **qimpltdd** chain 2 substitution used throughout.
- [ ] Layman closing table delivered.
